 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Relative effective Cartier divisors",
 "statement": "Let $f:X\\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. A *relative effective\nCartier divisor on $X/S$* is an effective Cartier divisor $D\\subset X$\nsuch that $D\\to S$ is flat (Divisors, Definition 31.19.2, Tag\n[062T](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/062T)).",
